  "body": "<!-- Release notes generated using configuration in .github/release.yml at 5.2.x -->\r\n\r\n## What's Changed\r\n### Improvements ⭐\r\n* Report an annotation the processor cannot read instead of emitting nonsense by @graemerocher in https://github.com/micronaut-projects/micronaut-core/pull/13366\r\n### Other Changes 💡\r\n* Do not enumerate @Bean(typed) beans by an indexed type they hide by @dstepanov in https://github.com/micronaut-projects/micronaut-core/pull/13473\r\n* Speed up the annotation processing test suites: C1-only JVMs, no inject-java re-forking, single Kotlin test compile by @dstepanov in https://github.com/micronaut-projects/micronaut-core/pull/13476\r\n\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/micronaut-projects/micronaut-core/compare/v5.2.7...v5.2.8",
